Thu Nov 19 07:28:41 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to 1.1.3:
  * ToolCallRequest.override(state=...): state overrides from
    wrap_tool_call now also replaces runtime.state, so the
    tool sees them via both InjectedState and ToolRuntime
  * Send-dispatched tool calls now get the same state as an
    edge: read the state the node would get from an edge,
    coerced to its input schema

