Sat Nov 14 07:46:08 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to 1.1.2:
  * create_react_agent: build the call_model missing-messages
    error only when raised instead of on every model call,
    speeding up long tool loops (same ValueError text)
  * ToolNode: allow the node name to be None

